ch/files/content/20230705/16885324393174.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230705/16885324492664.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"声音添加有四种方式，分别是上传、随机选择、录制以及从系统中选择，A选项为上传，B选项为随机选择，C选项为录制，D选项为系统选择。 所以答案为C。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如下图所示，程序运行前为第二个背景，运行程序后，背景切换为第几个背景？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230705/16885324916561.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230705/16885325049756.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：3"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：2"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：4"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：1"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"倒数第二个积木换成了“Bascketball2”背景，它的下一个背景是第4个。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"点击下列哪个标签能查看角色有几个造型？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230705/16885328952327.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230705/16885329174035.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230705/16885329261503.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230705/16885329336263.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"查看造型，应该在造型标签内查看。","auto":true},{"no":11,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"导出下面角色，在不修改名字的情况下，最终导出的文件名是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230706/16886315546984.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：鸡.jpg"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：鸡.sprite3"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：鸡.sb3"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：角色.sprite3"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"角色导出之后的后缀名是 sprite3，不修改角色的名字，前面的名字就是现在角色的名字“鸡”。","auto":true},{"no":12,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"使用下列哪个选项可以把小猫从左边变成右边的样子？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230706/16886316906263.png"}],"opti